    "source_quote": "Korea Telecom launched the KT NPU LLM Station on Wednesday &mdash; the first commercially available enterprise AI appliance to pair a Korean-made inference chip with a Korean-developed large language model in a single on-premises server &mdash; targeting a regulated-industry market that has been structurally locked out of generative AI by the country's strict network-separation rules .",
